          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngoba iNkosi yabona ukuthi ukuhlupheka kukaIsrayeli kwakukukhulu, wayengekho loyedwa oseleyo oyisigqili lokhululekileyo, kungasekho ongasiza uIsrayeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa iNkosi yayingatshongo ukuba izalisusa ibizo likaIsrayeli ngaphansi komthunzi welanga; yabakhulula ngesandla sikaJerobowamu indodana kaJowashi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ezinye indaba zikaJerobowamu, lakho konke akwenzayo, lobuqhawe bakhe, lokulwa kwakhe, lokubuyisa kwakhe koIsrayeli iDamaseko leHamathi, kulotshiwe ogwalweni lwezindaba zamakhosi akoIsrayeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UJerobowamu waya kwabaphansi, amakhosi akoIsrayeli. UZekariya indodana yakhe waba yinkosi esikhundleni sakhe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.29"
            ]
          }
        }
